GET http://localhost:5144/
###
# Minimal API routing examples
### Update the root resource
PUT http://localhost:5144/

### Delete the root resource
DELETE http://localhost:5144/

### Post to the root resource
POST http://localhost:5144/

### Bind route parameters
GET http://localhost:5144/users/123/posts/some-text

### Apply an integer route constraint
GET http://localhost:5144/products/5

### Bind an optional route parameter
GET http://localhost:5144/report/2023

### Bind query parameters
GET http://localhost:5144/search?q=sample&page=1

### Match a catch-all file path
GET http://localhost:5144/files/samplefile

### Match optional and catch-all store parameters
GET http://localhost:5144/store/electronics/123/some/extra/path

### Match the store route with an omitted optional parameter
GET http://localhost:5144/store/electronics/1234/

### Blog controller: get all blogs
GET http://localhost:5144/api/blogs

### Blog controller: get a blog by ID
GET http://localhost:5144/api/blogs/1

### Blog controller: create a blog
POST http://localhost:5144/api/blogs
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Following Blog Post",
    "content": "This is the content of the new blog post."
}

### Blog controller: update a blog
PUT http://localhost:5144/api/blogs/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Updated Blog Post",
    "content": "This is the updated content of the blog post."
}

### Blog controller: delete a blog
DELETE http://localhost:5144/api/blogs/2

### Product controller: get all products
GET http://localhost:5144/api/products

### Product controller: get a product by ID
GET http://localhost:5144/api/products/1

### Product controller: create a product
POST http://localhost:5144/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Monitor",
    "description": "27-inch display",
    "price": 249.99
}

### Product controller: update a product
PUT http://localhost:5144/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Updated Laptop",
    "description": "Updated description",
    "price": 1099.99
}

### Product controller: delete a product
DELETE http://localhost:5144/api/products/1

### Product controller: verify the product was deleted
GET http://localhost:5144/api/products/1

#### Error handling controller: test global exception handling
// GET http://localhost:5144/api/ErrorHandling/global-test

